{"id":"vd-a1-the-goalkeeper","level":"a1","n":16,"title":{"en":"You Can Do It!","vi":"Cậu làm được mà!"},"summary":"Giờ nghỉ giữa hiệp, Sophie ngồi buồn vì để lọt lưới; Amara và thầy Ray động viên cô bé trước khi vào sân lại.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a1-the-goalkeeper","level":"a1","title":{"en":"The Goalkeeper","vi":"Thủ môn"}},"scene":{"background":"park","props":[{"id":"soccer-ball","x":880,"y":730}]},"cast":{"sophie":{"name":{"en":"Sophie","vi":"Sophie"},"look":"girl","x":640,"style":{"hair":"ponytail","hairColor":"#C9923C","outfit":"uniform","top":"#5DBB63","topShade":"#4AA350","collar":"#FFFFFF"}},"amara":{"name":{"en":"Amara","vi":"Amara"},"look":"girl","x":320,"style":{"hair":"curly","hairColor":"#1F1A1C","skin":"#7A4A2E","skinShade":"#643A22","outfit":"uniform","top":"#5DBB63","topShade":"#4AA350","collar":"#FFFFFF"},"from":1},"ray":{"name":{"en":"Coach Ray","vi":"Thầy Ray"},"look":"man","x":1170,"style":{"outfit":"jacket","top":"#2F3A4A","topShade":"#1F2733","hat":"cap"},"from":6}},"lines":[{"speaker":"sophie","en":"I'm so sorry. It was my goal.","vi":"Tớ xin lỗi. Bàn thua đó là tại tớ.","ipa":["aɪm","soʊ","ˈsɑɹi","ɪt","wɑz","maɪ","ɡoʊl"],"start":0.554,"end":3.994,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,0.765],[2,1.177],[3,2.846],[4,3.059],[5,3.3],[6,3.542]]},{"speaker":"amara","en":"Sophie! Don't worry.","vi":"Sophie! Đừng lo.","ipa":["ˈsoʊfi","doʊnt","ˈwɝi"],"start":4.784,"end":7.084,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,4.784],[1,6.291],[2,6.633]]},{"speaker":"sophie","en":"But the ball was between my hands!","vi":"Nhưng quả bóng đã ở giữa hai tay tớ rồi mà!","ipa":["bʌt","ðə","bɔl","wɑz","bɪˈtwin","maɪ","hændz"],"start":7.874,"end":10.324,"expression":"tearful","timing":[[0,7.874],[1,8.037],[2,8.193],[3,8.605],[4,8.846],[5,9.358],[6,9.585]]},{"speaker":"amara","en":"It was a very hard kick.","vi":"Đó là một cú sút rất mạnh.","ipa":["ɪt","wɑz","ə","ˈvɛɹi","hɑɹd","kɪk"],"start":11.114,"end":12.784,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,11.114],[1,11.211],[2,11.408],[3,11.5],[4,11.948],[5,12.369]]},{"speaker":"sophie","en":"The tall boy is very good.","vi":"Cậu bé cao lớn đó giỏi lắm.","ipa":["ðə","tɔl","bɔɪ","ɪz","ˈvɛɹi","ɡʊd"],"start":13.574,"end":15.484,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,13.574],[1,13.66],[2,14.086],[3,14.427],[4,14.668],[5,15.109]]},{"speaker":"amara","en":"And you are very good, too. We need you!","vi":"Và cậu cũng rất giỏi mà. Cả đội cần cậu!","ipa":["ənd","ju","ɑɹ","ˈvɛɹi","ɡʊd","tu","wi","nid","ju"],"start":16.274,"end":20.184,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,16.274],[1,16.447],[2,16.683],[3,16.868],[4,17.328],[5,17.96],[6,19.265],[7,19.502],[8,19.857]]},{"speaker":"ray","en":"Amara is right, Sophie.","vi":"Amara nói đúng đấy, Sophie.","ipa":["ɑˈmɑɹə","ɪz","ɹaɪt","ˈsoʊfi"],"start":20.974,"end":22.834,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,20.974],[1,21.469],[2,21.682],[3,22.25]]},{"speaker":"sophie","en":"Coach, I'm afraid.","vi":"Thầy ơi, em sợ lắm.","ipa":["koʊtʃ","aɪm","əˈfɹeɪd"],"start":23.624,"end":25.204,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,23.624],[1,24.318],[2,24.559]]},{"speaker":"ray","en":"That's OK. Forget the goal.","vi":"Không sao. Quên bàn thua đi.","ipa":["ðæts","oʊˈkeɪ","fɚˈɡɛt","ðə","ɡoʊl"],"start":25.994,"end":28.864,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,25.994],[1,26.236],[2,27.791],[3,28.302],[4,28.43]]},{"speaker":"ray","en":"Watch the ball, not the boy.","vi":"Nhìn bóng thôi, đừng nhìn cậu bé đó.","ipa":["wɑtʃ","ðə","bɔl","nɑt","ðə","bɔɪ"],"start":29.404,"end":31.264,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,29.404],[1,29.699],[2,29.841],[3,30.451],[4,30.735],[5,30.849]]},{"speaker":"sophie","en":"Watch the ball… not the boy.","vi":"Nhìn bóng… đừng nhìn cậu bé.","ipa":["wɑtʃ","ðə","bɔl","nɑt","ðə","bɔɪ"],"start":32.054,"end":34.184,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,32.054],[1,32.397],[2,32.553],[3,33.306],[4,33.619],[5,33.761]]},{"speaker":"amara","en":"Yes! You can do it, Sophie!","vi":"Đúng rồi! Cậu làm được mà, Sophie!","ipa":["jɛs","ju","kæn","du","ɪt","ˈsoʊfi"],"start":34.974,"end":38.104,"expression":"happy","gesture":"cheer","timing":[[0,34.974],[1,36.33],[2,36.567],[3,36.803],[4,37.027],[5,37.501]]},{"speaker":"ray","en":"Now go. Good luck!","vi":"Giờ ra sân đi. Chúc may mắn!","ipa":["naʊ","ɡoʊ","ɡʊd","lʌk"],"start":38.894,"end":41.374,"expression":"happy","gesture":"wave","timing":[[0,38.894],[1,39.19],[2,40.617],[3,40.902]]},{"speaker":"sophie","en":"Thanks. I can do it!","vi":"Em cảm ơn. Em làm được!","ipa":["θæŋks","aɪ","kæn","du","ɪt"],"start":42.164,"end":44.664,"expression":"happy","gesture":"cheer","react":{"amara":"happy"},"timing":[[0,42.164],[1,43.724],[2,43.937],[3,44.207],[4,44.462]]}],"words":[{"id":"worry","en":"worry","ipa":"ˈwɝi","vi":"lo lắng; nỗi lo","level":0},{"id":"kick","en":"kick","ipa":"kɪk","vi":"đá; cú đá","level":0},{"id":"afraid","en":"afraid","ipa":"əˈfɹeɪd","vi":"sợ; e ngại","level":0},{"id":"goal","en":"goal","ipa":"ɡoʊl","vi":"mục tiêu; bàn thắng; khung thành","level":0},{"id":"forget","en":"forget","ipa":"fɚˈɡɛt","vi":"quên; quên mất","level":0}],"focus":{"title":"Động viên người khác","pattern":"Don't worry! · You can do it! · We need you. · Good luck!","explain":"Khi ai đó buồn hay lo, dùng câu ngắn và dứt khoát: \"Don't worry!\", \"You can do it!\". \"Good luck!\" là chúc may mắn trước khi làm việc khó. Người được động viên đáp \"Thanks!\".","keys":["don't worry","you can do it","good luck","we need you"],"lines":[1,5,11,12]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a1-the-goalkeeper.mp3","v":"ee912abb81","duration":45.768,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}